                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#1v">-1v</locus>قَالَ المَلَأِّ الذِيْنَ اسْتَكْبَرُوْا منْ قَوْمِهِ لَنُخْرِجَنِّكَ يَا شُعَيْبُ<note>It starts: "وقَالَ", but the wāw was deleted.
Fatḥa-s appear under šadda-s, like kasra-s.</note>
                     </incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#18v">-18v</locus>وَاِنْ تَوَلَوْا فَاعْلَمُوْا اَنِّ اللهَ مَوْلَيْكُمْ نِعْمَ المَوْلَيْ وَنِعْمَ النِّصِيْرُ<note>fatḥa-s appear under šadda-s, like kasra-s.</note>
                     </explicit>
                     <note>7:88-8:40. Eleven, then twelve lines a page. Title of sura al-Anfāl rubricated. Ihmāl marks (rā’-s). Some words were completed on the following line. Many words were not completed at the end of a line, and were rewritten in full on the following line. Deletions and corrections (f.2r, 7r, 11r, 14r, 14v, 15v). Two folios are upside down in the middle of the volume.</note>
                     <note/>
